Z||000010||theogre||08-16-99||10:39 PM||||I may be a bit more sensitive to POP(what one local company called it's PrOprietary information Protection program, or was it PIP, Hell if I care anymore.) than many people....... I had to deal with this off and on for over a decade. the recent legal B.S. has brought it back.........<p>I'm not trying to scare people. I'm trying to protect both forum users, and the forum.<p>I'm not saying anyone asked for anything. These days what people offer voluntarily can be enough to cause major shit to hit the fan.<p>I don't care a lick what people talk about most of the time. I just don't want to see anyone here end up neck deep in a goat load of boat shit......... 8)
